  "_what_this_is": "Row 36's texture library types. Emitted from tools/room-voices.mjs, which is the one home: the voices say what a surface is made of and this says how big it is. Do not hand-edit -- regenerate with `node tools/room-voices.mjs --emit-materials`.",
